# Every variable here is OPTIONAL.
#
# With no .env file at all, Waypoint runs against the bundled fixtures in
# src/data/fixtures — the full UI works offline, sign-in is hidden, and saved
# places persist to localStorage. That is the default `npm run dev` experience.
#
# Fill these in to read live data from Firestore and enable Google sign-in.
# The Firebase web API key is a public client identifier, not a secret: access
# is controlled by firestore.rules, not by hiding this value.

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=

# Basemap tiles. Defaults to CARTO Positron for light and Esri Dark Gray Canvas
# for dark, neither of which needs a key. The map's light/dark control switches
# between the two, so override both or the switch will only work one way.
# Each URL carries its own credit; override the attribution with it.
# VITE_TILE_URL=
# VITE_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=
# VITE_TILE_URL_DARK=
# VITE_TILE_ATTRIBUTION_DARK=
